//api.github.com/repos/Aqr-K/Moviepilot-Plugins/commits/b72bcbdedd3a8b05bd47fd81f49a80afc50820dd"}],"sha":"885ef0d96dbf1255ee989bc723a2106700d8a1d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aqr-K/Moviepilot-Plugins/commits/885ef0d96dbf1255ee989bc723a2106700d8a1d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/148100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/invalid-email-address","id":148100,"login":"invalid-email-address","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODEwMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aqr-K/Moviepilot-Plugins/commits/18715b384e2609af0a5ef8eed24c67e41b9678c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:33:55Z","email":"you@example.com","name":"Your Name"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:33:55Z","email":"you@example.com","name":"Your Name"},"message":"feat(automaticsubscriptionassistant): 发布适配 MoviePilot v3 的 3.0.0\n\n以 v3 原生形态重做自动订阅助手，并修复审计发现的缺陷。\n\n适配 v3\n- 媒体身份改用宿主统一的 media_source + media_id 二元组：v3 订阅表已无\n  tmdbid/doubanid/bangumiid 列，recognize_media 与 SubscribeChain.add 的旧参数\n  也已移除，识别、订阅落地与热门媒体来源均按新契约取用。\n- 宿主接口改吃 app.sdk 稳定契约面，不再依赖 app.core/app.log/app.utils/app.helper\n  兼容旁路；浏览器与服务端 helper 从 app.adapters 的真实路径导入。\n\n存储迁移\n- 订阅历史从插件 KV 迁入自管理表 subscribe_history，按行读写、写入即提交，\n  查询/分页/筛选/统计下推 SQL。年份区间比较独立的 year_num 整数列，避免对文本列\n  做 CAST 在 SQLite 与 PostgreSQL 上行为不一致。\n- 存量数据首次启动自动迁移，逐条隔离、幂等可重跑；完成后原值留档到备份键而非\n  直接删除，并写下带时间与条数的标记。\n- 修复历史并发覆盖：此前每个端点与每次运行各持一份全量快照、收尾整体覆盖，\n  运行期间删除的记录会被重新写回。\n- 新增「历史保留条数」配置，每轮运行后修剪，默认不限制。\n\n缺陷修复\n- 批量退订/暂停新增归属校验，不再能按 ID 改动非本插件创建的订阅；set_state\n  补存在性判定，修正成功条数虚报。\n- 订阅管理改用配置中的用户名，用户改名后不再列不出自己的订阅。\n- 整源抓取失败的兜底此前裹在生成器函数的调用点上、从未生效，改到迭代处。\n- 「立即运行」按来源合并重复触发，不再并发跑出多个任务互相覆盖历史。\n- 关闭调度器不再等待在途任务，保存配置的请求不会被阻塞。\n- 插件重载时不再丢失退出信号。\n- netflix 并发线程数加上限；豆瓣 RSS 拒绝带实体声明的文档并限制体积。\n\n前端\n- 删空末页后按纠正的页码重新拉取，不再显示「有 N 页却一条都没有」。\n- 「全选」改用新增的 /history/uniques 轻量端点，并接入时序守卫。\n- 关闭配置页不再残留轮询。\n- 定时表达式增加格式校验与三语提示。\n\n测试 177 passed，相对既有基线零新增回归。","tree":{"sha":"b1871834d37b34cc72aa7fcbb4c7008996ef50e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aqr-K/Moviepilot-Plugins/git/trees/b1871834d37b34cc72aa7fcbb4c7008996ef50e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aqr-K/Moviepilot-Plugins/git/commits/18715b384e2609af0a5ef8eed24c67e41b9678c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/148100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/invalid-email-address","id":148100,"login":"invalid-email-address","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODEwMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Aqr-K/Moviepilot-Plugins/commit/18715b384e2609af0a5ef8eed24c67e41b9678c2","node_id":"C_kwDOND83NdoAKDE4NzE1YjM4NGUyNjA5YWYwYTVlZjhlZWQyNGM2N2U0MWI5Njc4YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Aqr-K/Moviepilot-Plugins/commit/38e430ce45bedaa84db442f4a8f74fa395b22cba","sha":"38e430ce45bedaa84db442f4a8f74fa395b22cba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aqr-K/Moviepilot-Plugins/commits/38e430ce45bedaa84db442f4a8f74fa395b22cba"}],"sha":"18715b384e2609af0a5ef8eed24c67e41b9678c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aqr-K/Moviepilot-Plugins/commits/18715b384e2609af0a5ef8eed24c67e41b9678c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97807568?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAGIRIxr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAGIRIxr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAGIRIxr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAGIRIxr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SAGIRIxr","id":97807568,"login":"SAGIRIxr","node_id":"U_kgDOBdRs0A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAGIRIxr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAGIRIxr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAGIRIxr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAGIRIxr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAGIRIxr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAGIRIxr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aqr-K/Moviepilot-Plugins/commits/b72bcbdedd3a8b05bd47fd81f49a80afc50820dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:05:30Z","email":"2368627164@qq.com","name":"SAGIRIxr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T12:06:58Z","email":"95741669+Aqr-K@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Aqr-K"},"message":"fix(pluginmarketsautoupdate): 适配官方Wiki改版后的插件库地址结构，修复定时任务必定失败的问题，升级 2.1\n\n官方 Wiki https://wiki.movie-pilot.org/zh/plugin 改版后，\"可同步的公开插件仓库清单\"\n由 prismjs 代码块改为普通链接列表，页面上已不存在任何 <pre> 元素，原默认 Xpath\n命中数恒为 0，定时任务每次都以 \"未找到Xpath路径的值\" 失败。\n\n同时 __get_code 使用 ''''.join(code) 拼接结果，隐含了\"Xpath 只会命中单个文本节点\"\n的假设。在新的链接列表结构下，即使用户按插件说明自行把 Xpath 改为 //ul/li/a/@href，\n75 个地址也会被拼成一个无分隔符的长串，__valid_markets_list 按逗号切分后只会得到\n一条非法地址，因此说明中\"可自行修改 Xpath 以保证功能正常运行\"的自救路径同样不可用。\n\n本次改动：\n\n- 默认 Xpath 调整为 //ul/li/a[starts-with(@href,\"https://github.com/\")]/@href，\n  适配改版后的链接列表结构。\n- __get_code 改为分隔符感知拼接：命中结果全部以 http 开头时用逗号拼接，否则维持\n  原有的空字符串拼接行为，对旧的单代码块结构完全向后兼容。\n- init_plugin 加载时识别历史配置中遗留的旧 Xpath 并自动迁移到新默认值，否则存量\n  用户即使升级插件，仍会因配置中保存的旧 Xpath 继续失败。\n\n验证：在 MoviePilot v2 宿主容器内实际加载本插件并调用 get_wiki_list()，全新安装、\n存量旧配置、配置为空三条路径均稳定取得 75 条仓库地址，格式校验无异常。","tree":{"sha":"31baa770657d73024fb26de426a209f2b290ab78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aqr-K/Moviepilot-Plugins/git/trees/31baa770657d73024fb26de426a209f2b290ab78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aqr-K/Moviepilot-Plugins/git/commits/b72bcbdedd3a8b05bd47fd81f49a80afc50820dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95741669?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aqr-K","id":95741669,"login":"Aqr-K","node_id":"U_kgDOBbTm5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K/orgs","received_events_url