cba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T17:30:09Z","email":"95741669+Aqr-K@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Aqr-K"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T17:30:09Z","email":"95741669+Aqr-K@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Aqr-K"},"message":"fix(automaticsubscriptionassistant): 补 executor.py 缺失的 logger 导入，修复识别成功条目全部 error 的回归，升级 0.2.13\n\nv0.2.12 新增的订阅流程 DEBUG 日志（executor.py 第 100 行 logger.debug）引用了\n模块级 logger，但文件顶部漏了 from app.log import logger，导致每条识别成功的\n条目走到该行即抛 NameError，被 process() 的兜底 except 记为 error（订阅失败），\n表现为运行通知 error 偏高而 filtered/subscription_exists 正常。\n\n补上 from app.log import logger 后恢复正常订阅。现有 test_executor.py 已覆盖\n识别成功路径（15/15 通过），即为本回归的守卫。","tree":{"sha":"f742247106d472ed549ce15719adf586b67d175b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aqr-K/Moviepilot-Plugins/git/trees/f742247106d472ed549ce15719adf586b67d175b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aqr-K/Moviepilot-Plugins/git/commits/38e430ce45bedaa84db442f4a8f74fa395b22cba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95741669?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aqr-K","id":95741669,"login":"Aqr-K","node_id":"U_kgDOBbTm5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aqr-K","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"htt