t.com","name":"mehrabix"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T12:03:26Z","email":"mehrabi@post.com","name":"mehrabix"},"message":"Remove --metafile from bundle CLI; use analyze --outfile instead\n\nPer review feedback: the bundle command should not expose a metafile flag\nsince analyze --outfile already produces the same JSON. This avoids\npreset-bleed and keeps the CLI surface clean.\n\nThe shared infrastructure stays intact:\n- Traverse.BuildMetafile (shared between analyze and library API)\n- BundleOptions.MetafilePath (programmatic access)\n- OutputOptions.MetafilePath\n\nDocs updated to reference `analyze --outfile` as the canonical metafile path.","tree":{"sha":"b5a76d9cec4f6bc216274fb68d449a321fbe6459","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlorianRappl/netpack/git/trees/b5a76d9cec4f6bc216274fb68d449a321fbe6459"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlorianRappl/netpack/git/commits/dddfcf94c6642819ca3e6b0e5e049468282dccbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30565212?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehrabix","id":30565212,"login":"mehrabix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNTY1MjEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix","user_view_type":"pub