:"Remove --target CLI flag, refactor PresetConfig hierarchy per PR #23 review\n\n- Drop --target option from BundleCommand; multi-target is now\n  exclusively driven by preset variants via Program.cs loop\n- Extract BasePresetConfig so variant configs cannot define\n  recursive sub-variants\n- Consolidate duplicate MergeVariant into Presets (removed from\n  PresetArgs) — uses BasePresetConfig consistently\n- Make caches static so multi-target variant runs share the\n  parse cache across BundleCommand instances\n- Update internal design doc and remove --target from platforms.md\n- Add RollForward=Major to test project for .NET 10 runtime compat","tree":{"sha":"52b3778a403a64f63f5f4ed786929e64f3a3e0b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlorianRappl/netpack/git/trees/52b3778a403a64f63f5f4ed786929e64f3a3e0b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlorianRappl/netpack/git/commits/76b67808a6a8012d52789cdb0086c1b8d1d676bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30565212?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehrabix","id":30565212,"login":"mehrabix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNTY1MjEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrabix","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https