:"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/berfinyuksel","id":99557970,"login":"berfinyuksel","node_id":"U_kgDOBe8iUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/quill-bundle/commits/fe7e13c73baff879f97cc4fa5940dfef9772d3f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:57:47Z","email":"99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"berfinyuksel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:57:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Pass SYNC_TOKEN to the studio frontend build (#113)\n\nPart of pimcore/DevOps-Tasks#65. The studio frontend build pushes its automatic commits as pimcore-deployments and only on pushes to version branches; PR runs upload the build as an artifact instead (pimcore/workflows-collection-public#168). The push run no longer cancels an in-progress run; the head-commit check in the reusable prevents a commit loop.\n\nUntil #168 is merged the \"Studio Frontend Build\" check fails at startup with \"secret SYNC_TOKEN is not defined in the referenced workflow\". That is expected; the check gets re-run after the merge, before this PR is marked ready.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5b105ef0b00325116c84d536aa6ca1615360bfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/quill-bundle/git/trees/a5b105ef0b00325116c84d536aa6ca1615360bfa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/quill-bundle/git/commits/fe7e13c73baff879f