:"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sanity-io/sdk/commit/a89ac34d69093a82772b8e3b358c8acc3596b5ee","node_id":"C_kwDONHsbrtoAKGE4OWFjMzRkNjkwOTNhODI3NzJiOGUzYjM1OGM4YWNjMzU5NmI1ZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sanity-io/sdk/commit/c1f6fce7f64e8f78ce6f53525e07c498703f7cc9","sha":"c1f6fce7f64e8f78ce6f53525e07c498703f7cc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/commits/c1f6fce7f64e8f78ce6f53525e07c498703f7cc9"}],"sha":"a89ac34d69093a82772b8e3b358c8acc3596b5ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/commits/a89ac34d69093a82772b8e3b358c8acc3596b5ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2244375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gu-stav","id":2244375,"login":"gu-stav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDQzNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/commits/c1f6fce7f64e8f78ce6f53525e07c498703f7cc9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:01:08Z","email":"gu@stav.dev","name":"Gustav Hansen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:01:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(core): use \"dashboard\" auth mode for apps using the message bus (#1350)\n\n* fix(core): use dashboard auth mode when a message bus is installed\n\nFederated apps have no `_context` param, so they ran in standalone mode and\nread, wrote, and listened to the host''s localStorage token while the bus\nalso delivered one.\n\n* test(core): cover dashboard auth under the message bus at the store level\n\n* fix(core): keep the message bus out of the auth mode import graph\n\nauthMode now reads the installed-bus global from a leaf module instead of\nthe bus store, so every entry point reaching authStore doesn''t bundle the\nbus. Also covers the skipped storage-event subscription under the bus.\n\n* revert(core): read the installed bus through the store again\n\nCustomers load the whole app, so the leaf module only saved bytes on the\nagent entry point.\n\n* fix(core): keep the bus host on its own session\n\nThe app that installs the message bus also runs on the SDK. Resolving\ndashboard auth for any installed bus put the host itself in dashboard mode,\nso it started logged out with no token source. Only apps on a bus another\napp installed are guests now.\n\n* test(core): set the app ID explicitly in message bus guest tests","tree":{"sha":"6a8bcb69bb6f91b8fc4aab03638d91f7d01e86ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/git/trees/6a8bcb69bb6f91b8fc4aab03638d91f7d01e86ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/git/commits/c1f6fce7f64e8f78ce6f53525e07c498703f7cc9","verification":{"payload":"tree 6a8bcb69bb6f91b8fc4aab03638d91f7d01e86ec\nparent 2c9a9e032f2bf403e7eae736831d55c521d3f55e\nauthor Gustav Hansen <gu@stav.dev> 1790848868 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790848868 +0200\n\nfix(core): use \"dashboard\" auth mode for apps using the message bus (#1350)\n\n* fix(core): use dashboard auth mode when a message bus is installed\n\nFederated apps have no `_context` param, so they ran in standalone mode and\nread, wrote, and listened to the host''s localStorage token while the bus\nalso delivered one.\n\n* test(core): cover dashboard auth under the message bus at the store level\n\n* fix(core): keep the message bus out of the auth mode import graph\n\nauthMode now reads the installed-bus global from a leaf module instead of\nthe bus store, so every entry point reaching authStore doesn''t bundle the\nbus. Also covers the skipped storage-event subscription under the bus.\n\n* revert(core): read the installed bus through the store again\n\nCustomers load the whole app, so the leaf module only saved bytes on the\nagent entry point.\n\n* fix(core): keep the bus host on its own session\n\nThe app that installs the message bus also runs on the SDK. Resolving\ndashboard auth for any installed bus put the host itself in dashboard mode,\nso it started logged out with no token source. Only apps on a bus another\napp installed are guests now.\n\n* test(core): set the app ID explicitly in message bus guest tests","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvi9kCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAW18QAIe0uSJ9gV04kUpDNv2nXFAK\ngwdFPFjlyDmZRdw694BPU24pzMjf6glXRfxUjk8KuE8oT8k6fWAEOvPSaPNyItPA\njlnsSy7pYgIWLFejlDAyamyuZwlS0SyHOknjr2q/o1lAL4m5MDGjQM5JfkD+wQVx\nJNyIiljn9fZIs5zXQaz1ZgUBnloEyQPMBQgegveI1fz1s/aQUupxwijXhey0KF3T\nGczuhHm9F5ZhJb9vF00hAYYn265TwuEe0e2Ecu8pJT/5Iz3rRwPrTnKrF9Zf0LLc\nTaINdlVsBBjwMkOJUX2Eo0AqE2MeqGbN2LMO32fRwzke3a5EXlLNOoz19Er01/y6\nPoy9ejCTXAvAdwNCmW6Y5iRKGeNLuGKKQ3bFzJFoLDP2iCkFUVuFPBov7hamcQEP\nDcr8+5d3yyj3TZzM54EByJAOGvdp8vTYgvuosb4oJ6jCscSD1+7xJcZSpTpHc3SD\ngBt0AzWhAwkrCnjsWvXMp07A6gXEtxr/XpePKUF9j/Ym0EWwXg6xIHqRLJSjFsLV\nXqvl/+5aiTFVWKb+NcXZ+teKsAyw3Os/zkV6xD/ZTQHUBjVniLIGiMyQpg1CdZQ/\n2wREa/WdnihnY/jvfdl5X2x5J9Cs4WCavrXuCeimt5RDSm/lskxZTH5grtTYULe7\nEydLxy+tgz3PZd72D49c\n=hmV7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T10:01:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.g