rl":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gu-stav","id":2244375,"login":"gu-stav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDQzNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/commits/5d54e864646f90f0ccdba9973c865eee5833d95c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:02:44Z","email":"gu@stav.dev","name":"Gustav Hansen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:02:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(react): ask for project access over the message bus (#1349)\n\n* feat(react): ask for project access over the message bus\n\nA federated SDK app lacking project access showed a dead-end\n\"Authentication Error\" screen, because LoginError only treated Comlink as\nthe dashboard. Under the bus, other 401s also logged the user out although\nthe host owns the session.\n\n* fix(react): fall back to comlink when the bus can''t connect\n\nLoginError renders as an error boundary fallback, so throwing from useEmit\nwhen an installed bus has no connection for this instance crashed the tree\ninstead of showing the auth error.\n\n* test(react): assert the comlink fallback when the bus can''t connect\n\n* fix(react): warn when the dashboard declines or misses the access request\n\nThe reply is lazy, so a declined request or a missing responder vanished\nsilently while LoginError hides the Retry button for projectUserNotFound.","tree":{"sha":"3179c7480c1d589938d66b04b61b79c2b58c441f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/git/trees/3179c7480c1d589938d66b04b61b79c2b58c441f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/git/commits/5d54e864646f90f0ccdba9973c865eee5833d95c","verification":{"payload":"tree 3179c7480c1d589938d66b04b61b79c2b58c441f\nparent 2a9928b71e405f089d51c646e35ba1b3dcfb90e1\nauthor Gustav Hansen <gu@stav.dev> 1790838164 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790838164 +0200\n\nfeat(react): ask for project access over the message bus (#1349)\n\n* feat(react): ask for project access over the message bus\n\nA federated SDK app lacking project access showed a dead-end\n\"Authentication Error\" screen, because LoginError only treated Comlink as\nthe dashboard. Under the bus, other 401s also logged the user out although\nthe host owns the session.\n\n* fix(react): fall back to comlink when the bus can''t connect\n\nLoginError renders as an error boundary fallback, so throwing from useEmit\nwhen an installed bus has no connection for this instance crashed the tree\ninstead of showing the auth error.\n\n* test(react): assert the comlink fallback when the bus can''t connect\n\n* fix(react): warn when the dashboard declines or misses the access request\n\nThe reply is lazy, so a declined request or a missing responder vanished\nsilently while LoginError hides the Retry button for projectUserNotFound.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvgWUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARFUQABSMjOIAJQ7rbwWeMy2LjFMI\nCXOooRPLpnxAV3Y0SyKYuFvXnxbkMH06KU8Qf/dbyQ5VQYFWksLGpXZCE8FvfCve\nvgaF/dRAlHRG6n6hcT3tnwjokHi24G64DKSYtmrOfaOxzV+fH+3Tdj4J81UvbY6q\nPpLnEHf8/xBYO0yHZbCiYBuBROXzTWYGqGlu2N/Iq2B2EpgIhmuU+9zBbKsQMo0n\nEOTuX9FyGk2QxUhC4cW7QV7Xm1lVWaKMnuDJkFrR2pnI6GWkcXKpjzKkhX7Traxz\nZ/5OfzTAffmqZCqbvctdQCUO9lzzHncFOsNKSmkRj3LXXw0+cCnRXk1PtypgDY5z\nYzWmjAFUjjUL5KqKjDLevyZEA3vy3YnkxTLy3W+TOpnole702bY7quP+q66fe+qy\nDvSKVu0lZvLQHbEnQDF/YWRmQgUVIXTIL515bT01C+iALDK452RFKMlO7Yi66EFM\nUP2nH6A