u@stav.dev> 1790837758 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790837758 +0200\n\ntest(core): fix flaky document propagation test (#1335)\n\n* test(core): wait for both instances to sync in propagation test\n\nInstance2 could miss its initial snapshot when instance1 submitted first,\nso the test read undefined on slow CI runners.\n\n* test(core): wait for both instances in the other two-instance tests\n\nThe optimistic and concurrent edit tests had the same race: a late instance2 read undefined or\nedited against an already-updated base, which skipped the merge path.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvgP+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKukQAFrYg4/fNHfpXJy0GPJ7tFBX\noMKlpnQIc1Da/wovCg5899rYe9Z0fjZao3S5nWQUpGU4CJ98goY7NKhRKMw2iEoY\nHpq1eIodEjfsNP+k2quUtxT7mUThk5wpKxNbZkzQpwG3Zg9J04wkPlbbeF9Yl2ak\nqLTZdMdIbkBYE6xAbdWeYqH7zaO4XAUuBxRGQOTdPFWxvhv1toSX4oGq1EzWZfP8\npSxo245/L9KiTMwA5pdGjUvtfoPJ3qbQygEzF43IGv5DUoNn3wWDpfzrbubMmnko\nK1mOavdxio6i2G08TisJ5TsxfW01jQTqUJUMSr1ar95WfBosvFeNosmPyXQWcXzu\n+Y9c5VdW1ivDAMXVpdX2VEaq7BYqkZRzAL/pHbUXDmGfkJ7EQCv4GJ50s0XKS91A\nRwC1A1KSmpgmCZJRzkTcxtxM2PaA5XZ/Jqz3qSr55fk/AlCozRd+BTObF087beSb\nxHvaXtdYkE09hIdftbvzkS1fqRy+/8uQB0gtS/7a3Bw+Hjhj5IjA6trBBvTY2iGZ\nDf9D31UvdqXlB1C/OllKx5syAY5Hmd780Tvt6BbF2AsPxmuH9zB1BiijG7dUbca/\nUJc4T2dAAq32rHav1DtXbMxpH+hKYf4/LcEoR5Vym2cc64zNWCcxKLYQ5Pgc1++b\nSj/lDuZxMPeHyhyTImQt\n=9tY/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T06:55:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https: