EzODBkMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sanity-io/sdk/commit/c3078180d24b5001c49c8e1108d421b6bb166435","sha":"c3078180d24b5001c49c8e1108d421b6bb166435","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/commits/c3078180d24b5001c49c8e1108d421b6bb166435"}],"sha":"4a4f3b035a680c5972d6be45e1636cb8fa380d18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/commits/4a4f3b035a680c5972d6be45e1636cb8fa380d18"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2244375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gu-stav","id":2244375,"login":"gu-stav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDQzNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/commits/c3078180d24b5001c49c8e1108d421b6bb166435/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:45:15Z","email":"gu@stav.dev","name":"Gustav Hansen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:45:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(react): make the favorites hooks work under the message bus (#1319)\n\n* feat(core): route favorites through the dashboard message bus\n\nFavorites hung in Workbench because they only spoke comlink.\nPick the bus or comlink like other dashboard hooks.\nWorkbench can answer the new host-owned favorites topics.\n\n* refactor(react): pick the favorites transport in the hooks\n\nEvery other dashboard hook branches between the bus and comlink in React, so core\nfavorites stays comlink-only. The bus path follows favorites.documents live, and\nthe host publishes null when it has no favorites instead of letting reads time out.\n\n* fix(react): gate bus favorites on the host capability\n\nA host without favorites never publishes favorites.documents, so reading it waited\nfor the query deadline and threw instead of answering false like comlink does.\nAlso match on the document type and omit an empty schemaName, so both transports\nagree on the same input.\n\n* test(react): cover the favorites capability flipping at runtime\n\nThe capability gate was only tested while off. Favorites can be installed or\nwithdrawn mid-session, and an update without a responder has to reject right away\ninstead of leaving the hook pending.\n\n* fix(react): match bus favorites without schemaName like dashboard\n\nDashboard''s favorite query and remove never compare schemaName, so a favorite\nstored under another workspace name has to read as favorited in Workbench too.\n\n* fix(react): degrade bus favorites like comlink on failed reads and slow writes\n\nA host that advertises favorites but never publishes or refuses the topic\ncrashed readers to the error boundary, and bus writes gave up after 5s where the\nDashboard write waits 10s. Both now behave like the Comlink path.\n\n* fix(core): match bus favorites by published id and workspace like dashboard\n\nDashboard identifies a favorite by its published document id (`_stableId`),\ntype and the embedding app''s resource, which for a studio includes the\nworkspace. The bus read compared raw ids and ignored schemaName, so draft and\nversion ids read as not favorited and a favorite from another workspace read\nas favorited.\n\nCore already owns the Comlink favorite status and write. The bus status, its\nmatching and its write now sit next to them, so the hooks only pick the\ntransport, like the rest of the SDK.","tree":{"sha":"b5f63d9cada71b26b342775f0aca3263a5d5e04e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/git/trees/b5f63d9cada71b26b342775f0aca3263a5d5e04e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/git/commits/c3078180d24b5001c49c8e1108d421b6bb166435","verification":{"payload":"tree b5f63d9cada71b26b342775f0aca3263a5d5e04e\nparent 12c7e12c590a78e36e05e15343d0e7ca36a2067a\nauthor Gustav Hansen <gu@stav.dev> 1790336715 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790336715 +0200\n\nfeat(react): make the favorites hooks work under the message bus (#1319)\n\n* feat(core): route favorites through the dashboard message bus\n\nFavorites hung in Workbench because they only spoke comlink.\nPick the bus or comlink like other dashboard hooks.\nWorkbench can answer the new host-owned favorites topics.\n\n* refactor(react): pick the favorites transport in the hooks\n\nEvery other dashboard hook branches between the bus and comlink in React, so core\nfavorites stays comlink-only. The bus path follows favorites.documents live, and\nthe host publishes null when it has no favorites instead of letting reads time out.\n\n* fix(react): gate bus favorites on the host capability\n\nA host without favorites never publishes favorites.documents, so reading it waited\nfor the query deadline and threw instead of answering false like comlink does.\nAlso match on the document type and omit an empty schemaName, so both transports\nagree on the same input.\n\n* test(react): cover the favorites capability flipping at runtime\n\nThe capability gate was only tested while off. Favorites can be installed or\nwithdrawn mid-session, and an update without a responder has to reject right away\ninstead of leaving the hook pending.\n\n* fix(react): match bus favorites without schemaName like dashboard\n\nDashboard''s favorite query and remove never compare schemaName, so a favorite\nstored under another workspace name has to read as favorited in Workbench too.\n\n* fix(react): degrade bus favorites like comlink on failed reads and slow writes\n\nA host that advertises favorites but never publishes or refuses the topic\ncrashed readers to the error boundary, and bus writes gave up after 5s where the\nDashboard write waits 10s. Both now behave like the Comlink path.\n\n* fix(core): match bus favorites by published id and workspace like dashboard\n\nDashboard identifies a favorite by its published document id (`_stableId`),\ntype and the embedding app''s resource, which for a studio includes the\nworkspace. The bus read compared raw ids and ignored schemaName, so draft and\nversion ids read as not favorited and a favorite from another workspace read\nas favorited.\n\nCore already owns the Comlink favorite status and write. The bus status, its\nmatching and its write now sit next to them, so the hooks only pick the\ntransport, like the rest of the SDK.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtl7LCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAz0YQACSq4WKhVM/+zPgdPaqLpXEf\nqO4Jmy15m6aUI66bGqe3FZ7eZHLHRhkrbu3GG6OnUmttXY7VAfw3C+mZvALhnViG\nAgt6RgzbTDgQUmIPWQGi998BhClQOmmAiL3Ja4Hm+q+UUrj6nMMUZ8WnHdmRkISs\nh07/bTlGa2YJPbcFQwA8ulM8Lu8NwTmOXjP4PVPlzjOeAmkOaXbdFJFI2/jV+p7Z\ncdVYEbc6Yb/Rg2MxOz6fTAKx/hZ1vIXCOjycF4jEkqnjyeRR/hZ7i4h85S87r6MY\nTQi4h9SsNA19y2WCX5NIq3sjMW/8INC+n5pFjC/CXh3CMp81RbPc25N6dKlbapqa\nbkgIhvQrSQZQhKA9ZHNH+kttyxqg3FJtNulerltFMyGNA6OI+bWQWDatHc/OTNvZ\nPmDSLe5rmOO3zNldA6REPlMFbugT8VLF08bchkbBNwGaIsDnD5XqiMd4jPHlivuq\ngLGrFwLzad+zbdyIHuw78YFj3D7uUPhnmv0KWZ6Fp1tIgbTJ76dMtOibPz1bPTpk\nLTOuZSAhMghv+L6zymoVexXloBbayxX75+VDOzK7zbuzF7Q0TS8wWkOjGm24IjEP\nDUv23cJJIg1HVdTc3gyGzdp3OOVIArEwqJp15bludnikQeqfHey773hlcjFfoPiS\niYCcYWW4FXJZEkSI9fTz\n=vk7X\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T11:45:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"