\n\nLimit preloading to sync assets, so exposes still render warm while\nlazy chunks load when used. On staging this cuts 123 KB gzip on home,\n285 KB on a studio page, and 982 KB on home with the current Content\nAgent build.","tree":{"sha":"ea4523a161f3683c23167391537b08f0dda13f5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/git/trees/ea4523a161f3683c23167391537b08f0dda13f5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/git/commits/8feb564f9382d7406e4396d2897062f0ba84b125","verification":{"payload":"tree ea4523a161f3683c23167391537b08f0dda13f5f\nparent ee458fc064de7e38692fea15a074946a245f41b3\nauthor Gustav Hansen <gu@stav.dev> 1790237588 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790237588 +0200\n\nperf(react): keep async remote chunks on demand (#1316)\n\nPreloading all remote resources pulled every lazily imported async\nchunk into the initial page load. Because the workbench warms every\napp''s panel at boot, Content Agent downloaded shiki''s grammars and its\nWASM engine on every page.\n\nLimit preloading to sync assets, so exposes still render warm while\nlazy chunks load when used. On staging this cuts 123 KB gzip on home,\n285 KB on a studio page, and 982 KB on home with the current Content\nAgent build.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtNuUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2uMQAARK6Aw0liwgi1iwy06GuOgf\n1DqJ4J5uAJ2udFoI0sfYrbdpB5+Hxa0DocrAzI8RXvExgBbhyACMdbIOY6RrONhG\n9Qh6+j1LwjOWtOO4QIMb9+fspbfL2hqrRKG0gVvI43mEh4vPxLZaO/qbTptqRKTM\n9Fbjov2o4ihLU7EIg/r7BNxIen7zRAzWMZyzhRC4/s9qW2e16LfWXrzjUkYJdu3Z\ne1QOYLBGL/6PxC+bfkSoCP0V4h7xfjOw6ECm2dZLxEW6F+vhGbDzb8UiamrxrDRb\nUBWsp1/jTfvlQqKQOfZOCzfeVkTSjuEHJN6P9nPAiM03CMyaoTct2ISBiNIg9rxz\nU3K+VZwPhOM7Soifm+xsIQIg00UG/1kp0ZIPrvbDqAXjie6/1Cf/jXSQn7zz/N+l\n1oRXWpC46LSCRrxbW0970pJDKB1C4XCO5S7PyMLrOhLgJSDaPtCWCelxSj/Rpb7R\n1yAQmfOxU/VFA723Lr8zswNetq8gFVq5w9lc3rWplhS7kHaarmxHwu1qbf/McBAl\nmhDZlVxCkC8UgV9KKWJHCcQQ4cqUztxGrXED5TbrrisNozPKtu/d0bOpG3hGPtv/\n50sIO2hg5Z+DLh2eqhXECSEai00