-io/sdk/git/trees/fcff54f282d5b284eccfe9167790c07e56f90f2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/sdk/git/commits/50c39184d43409ae887d469a7bb09e576cbc8302","verification":{"payload":"tree fcff54f282d5b284eccfe9167790c07e56f90f2d\nparent 3c783f71cd8f587dae27e0a18a406ded8a58b749\nauthor Josh <37798644+joshuaellis@users.noreply.github.com> 1790104114 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790104114 +0100\n\nfeat(react): drive OAuth flow from AuthBoundary (#1223)\n\n* feat(react): drive OAuth flow from AuthBoundary\n\n* fix(core): only treat code/error params as an OAuth callback\n\nA stray ?state= on the redirect URI booted into LOGGING_IN with nothing to\nexchange, leaving AuthBoundary rendering the callback component forever.\nAlso stores authorize rejections in a wrapper so a falsy reason still surfaces\nas an AuthError, and restores the AuthBoundary note in useHandleOAuthCallback\nnow that handleAuthCallback delegates to the OAuth path.\n\n* chore: add changeset for #1223","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqstIyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8+wQAJBsScIK9Z4pMPCj6Rkj/rYI\ndWlD8HytRSIpO9T7zbi8rrxgyeWR1+TsQgFwpvAD7pT2xq8yTh0gEdS9/L+UTwWB\n5V+EFRpWbYNMacDfAPBxkfNbEjth3N7gzMJEGq3rL5RFvAgZ7R3wgcSheCsLeYOJ\nKs/2mzCnhGPXMjx/kyfYMf0P8QjjatNKI/V+gh74UnNzyZseWvSk+EKLWQxsozRA\nitcNtEyNBMPz1M36gBs/o7qzklr5ZCC4R9WOeuJO+XWXi2896qPTuHAZy+HPLSNw\n54ZZ4znmJPDrT591NXhRO6QfnM5KJ7XLbdT4xFHqEYJKhAGGRr0HOA6aAGMazKHe\nj9snF/v6tOKcj6vuqMRwpozEcaSIhYjqYn83QREE4523F/8l32n3G5GwScSyhi5k\nL6vfovg8T4K+FvDS9/sN01SFE53bNRqzveVvIFNQmnhK20M3hK0oLd9KFKDUqY+b\nKPDa2NjB9HMuCG2Is3lb5aFiB/zCuAGuOQPQRckigbZJgoId4hlrmXfgUaE6X3Ab\nG8xkabvjIh4k50LKJXKr0eHGFTMKaV5ZT52mYzKfU6QiotBdv+Pf+BSpwv60O/CK\nvDioSFQv9z9cyTrfmVDSRnQsLsj6LkIkUIoVokXeNsTlNAnKrQuA3wg5dEJlDZkR\nZGdV0z4kkLaDwk2UMzXR\n=qxyI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-22T19:08:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_ur