public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ariel-gallardo/restaurante/commits/6322c1f93c53840d44720256dd7acbdb59994046/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T17:48:22Z","email":"38444032+ariel-gallardo@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ariel Gallardo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T17:48:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(shared-shell): implement internationalization, dark mode, and premium footer (#30)\n\nIntroduce a unified theme (light/dark) and translation system (ES/EN) across both\nv1 (AngularJS) and v2 (Angular) applications via the shared-shell NgRx state.\n\n- Add a centralized translations dictionary under the shared shell library.\n- Refactor v1 and v2 navigation bars to integrate theme switching and language selection.\n- Implement a responsive premium footer component available in both application shells.\n- Synchronize theme configuration and language choice persistence utilizing localStorage.\n- Enhance UI responsive behaviors, modern layout wrappers, and status badge visuals.\n- Fix compilation issues by declaring dom libraries on the shared shell tsconfig.","tree":{"sha":"bd5ce2e471fc236ae07399e4541f703cfc7f08c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ariel-gallardo/restaurante/git/trees/bd5ce2e471fc236ae07399e4541f703cfc7f08c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ariel-gallardo/restaurante/git/commits/6322c1f93c53840d44720256dd7acbdb59994046","verification":{"payload":"tree bd5ce2e471fc236ae07399e4541f703cfc7f08c2\nparent 4722740c5de9feb3763e232b7967ab48646fbb7a\nauthor Ariel Gallardo <38444032+ariel-gallardo@users.noreply.github.com> 1782582502 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782582502 -0300\n\nfeat(shared-shell): implement internationalization, dark mode, and premium footer (#30)\n\nIntroduce a unified theme (light/dark) and translation system (ES/EN) across both\nv1 (AngularJS) and v2 (Angular) applications via the shared-shell NgRx state.\n\n- Add a centralized translations dictionary under the shared shell library.\n- Refactor v1 and v2 navigation bars to integrate theme switching and language selection.\n- Implement a responsive premium footer component available in both application shells.\n- Synchronize theme configuration and language choice persistence utilizing localStorage.\n- Enhance UI responsive behaviors, modern layout wrappers, and status badge visuals.\n- Fix compilation issues by declaring dom libraries on the shared shell tsconfig.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQAzmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAF2wQACyZykf+sKnIN+4woJbhtSnt\nZJkGnxBVxFsWyrhEKt8VYjsXxf/VgWOGSo/ie9OwhIxGyKxaxonSwcFJYxRHFhwt\ngYggK+C5JReXkQjmrOgU0wUPMfTISbzLgQuYNRCEP+XpSosuirywq/kFT5QZ7f2Y\nCtLKsArQch5jjPYgDc1/XS59m5G2Fy62UQulDIMOsFnbLHmxeIh0UTdgykMjf3ip\nnLXTdyq++otwModDK6LSPsaF+l74MD0mNUXG6Y2rLyuFLh9Hy+P8MgzdtwamNpuc\nMJjDTX/PcEVukY80ktCbqAu0r9KIO35aq0s+skv5LaKgw1x70ANZa/LRkneoaixh\nH1gEvBpQXsnUUXX80BAxZUbqxTC5R6zZwHB/W/Q4/IyAqYBq0+21hEVWE2FwJcLx\nmwLJ/xeRQlIo/dnE7q905EnDTyATPynGtpcLGvf+/hb3Cd9CE+DR4jRPK8SdL3Qz\nsIyL8lTdfMWjXaJ4GO427pK5dBy9oqKnIHz716/IKXkIDcafgEzMvluLskOTY7Vc\n9U7bcV5ssiPAOncsob53o04db4UVuaR4O5N2tZb0bteNvVesXG2A26yEOJ5iCVI9\nrdvsytEYqyKgn0OYikDrGnOLGrerQBG9BFSHqjQvtHw+d4adNG6+g6GK6+RL05w+\n+xOuL6N2QqME6M2Pz+Ob\n=Ne+K\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-27T17:48:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com