comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ariel-gallardo/restaurante/commits/4722740c5de9feb3763e232b7967ab48646fbb7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T19:32:53Z","email":"38444032+ariel-gallardo@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ariel Gallardo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T19:32:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(v2): integrate global state sync with v1 and implement profile management (#29)\n\n- Integrated NgRx store decoration within the AngularJS $ngRedux provider to sync user sessions, cart counts, and order statuses between v1 and v2.\n- Implemented a unified logout routine using NgRx Effects that securely purges auth tokens and redirects to the login screen.\n- Added a standalone Profile component in the v2 Shell featuring reactive forms and seamless updates back to the legacy user API.\n- Installed @angular/material, @angular/cdk, and browser animation support to establish modern UI component patterns.\n- Adjusted v1 navbar conditions to correctly hide legacy elements when the v2 environment context is actively running.","tree":{"sha":"43f34c5616ef5249151acb7aa6272bcd9a754fee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ariel-gallardo/restaurante/git/trees/43f34c5616ef5249151acb7aa6272bcd9a754fee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ariel-gallardo/restaurante/git/commits/4722740c5de9feb3763e232b7967ab48646fbb7a","verification":{"payload":"tree 43f34c5616ef5249151acb7aa6272bcd9a754fee\nparent db8e0472689bbe968b866ef094f5e9b81cf9a897\nauthor Ariel Gallardo <38444032+ariel-gallardo@users.noreply.github.com> 1782502373 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782502373 -0300\n\nfeat(v2): integrate global state sync with v1 and implement profile management (#29)\n\n- Integrated NgRx store decoration within the AngularJS $ngRedux provider to sync user sessions, cart counts, and order statuses between v1 and v2.\n- Implemented a unified logout routine using NgRx Effects that securely purges auth tokens and redirects to the login screen.\n- Added a standalone Profile component in the v2 Shell featuring reactive forms and seamless updates back to the legacy user API.\n- Installed @angular/material, @angular/cdk, and browser animation support to establish modern UI component patterns.\n- Adjusted v1 navbar conditions to correctly hide legacy elements when the v2 environment context is actively running.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPtPlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQqUQAI5sl8WqWWyJt1mjNpazJeSo\no4Vl6fb1761Ikwi9i3RcxWbrjRYM6kzYctSttBsVRDW++pxp1bHTDFR5jK7Qws9w\nsdNlHJv9AA5KVPAd8xhOZwPziMcKqiPZObwnsFXusdtfsn8d8xbn0jtrDKtrswVJ\nBtxpcKWABNjMP79ti10LALSSrotD+QcT/gFaSLfufX4XwMFkc3OK0Ei8D1uF2pBt\nAbDxGXgVR61I7DiLnUsf9Z/5itqxgnr1sTW1qDOwWSYFWXiY0/y5uajrDGGhZ+tn\nFXjKQ2c9B1JwO41FbFCAcOiEoYQcIksKRqOBiZDHTN6KJAGTJDtSvdU2DOBeQLFD\n9Jgz58P9uBaDabgE84JHtiJLOu5i+KX1+zDDV8ZM752USjbpv8MrfARqV+lS/NFJ\nThhhUDapA354175alq37M+IrapdtYrCM93kT+OLJl5/j+XXdME3F92r8ja6Xy4Te\nglhth8P6y/ePceLL1NxWHmJCCC5+3BttsI0dQ8oF+dNBeG493epDse1CUEQejpUA\nWGAZAxt5UMREeSh6AvdgDs1dkki4QTzrSImrgzEhGPwoYmdEPV4AxezAQiYHLT0K\ntL5d82YEBzgIfJth4TCb6e14sGSuCb4A/W5V+VSPghqspqeqHWVjSJfZX0zHlE5e\nMQ89N1EwdvwMbIScKbwY\n=KhPT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-26T19:32:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ariel-gallardo/restaurante/commit/4722740c5de9feb3763e232b7967ab48646fbb7a","node_id":"C_kwDONIQ--toAKDQ3MjI3NDBjNWRlOWZlYjM3NjNlMjMyYjc5NjdhYjQ4NjQ2ZmJiN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ariel-gallardo/restaurante/commit/db8e0472689bbe968b866ef094f5e9b81cf9a897","sha":"db8e0472689bbe968b866ef094f5e9b81cf9a897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ariel-gallardo/restaurante/commits/db8e0472689bbe968b866ef094f5e9b81cf9a897"}],"sha":"4722740c5de9feb3763e232b7967ab48646fbb7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ariel-gallardo/restaurante/commits/4722740c5de9feb3763e232b7967ab48646fbb7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38444032?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel-gallardo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel-gallardo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel-gallardo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel-gallardo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ariel-gallardo","id":38444032,"login":"ariel-gallardo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NDQ0MDMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel-gallardo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel-gallardo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel-gallardo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel-gallardo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel-gallardo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel-gallardo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ariel-gallardo/restaurante/commits/db8e0472689bbe968b866ef094f5e9b81cf9a897/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T16:55:26Z","email":"38444032+ariel-gallardo@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ariel Gallardo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T16:55:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feature/shell (#28)\n\n* refactor: restructure monorepo into versioned apps and libs\n- Rename apps/legacy-angularjs to apps/v1 and apps/restaurante-v2 to apps/v2.\n- Update workspace naming conventions from @org to @resto for better domain alignment.\n- Migrate LegacyHostComponent and ShellModule logic into dedicated libraries (libs/v1 and libs/v2).\n- Configure Nx project.json and tsconfig files to support the new directory structure and path mappings.\n- Clean up boilerplate files including the default nx-welcome component and unused routes.\n- Update the v2 bootstrap process to utilize the new library-based ShellModule.\n\n* refactor: restructure monorepo by modularizing shell and legacy-host libs\n\nRefactors the project structure to improve domain isolation and dependency management within the Nx monorepo.\n\nKey changes include:\n- Created a dedicated `@resto/shell` library under `libs/v2/shell`, moving the main dashboard and shell module logic out of the generic `v2` library.\n- Created a standalone `@resto/legacy-host` library within `libs/v1` to encapsulate the mounting logic for legacy (v1) components.\n- Updated `tsconfig.base.json` with new path mappings for the relocated libraries.\n- Standardized project configurations (ESLint, TSConfig, and Project JSON) for the new sub-libraries.\n- Cleaned up exports in the original `v1` and `v2` entry points to reflect the new architecture.\n- Adjusted the main application bootstrap in `apps/v2` to consume the new shell package.\n\n* refactor(shell): relocate shell library to a nested directory structure\nRelocated the shell library from ''libs/v2/shell'' to ''libs/v2/src/lib/shell'' to align with the project''s folder architecture.\n\nThis change includes:\n- Updated relative paths in ''tsconfig.json'', ''tsconfig.lib.json'', and ''eslint.config.mjs''.\n- Corrected ''sourceRoot'' and schema paths in ''project.json''.\n- Adjusted path mappings in ''tsconfig.base.json'' to maintain ''@resto/shell'' imports.\n- Added a project reference to ''v1/tsconfig.lib.json'' within the shell''s library configuration.\n\n* feat(state): implement NgRx and cross-app shared shell tracking\n\n- Add @ngrx/store, @ngrx/effects, and @ngrx/store-devtools dependencies.\n- Create libs/shared/shell to manage aggregate state between versions.\n- Implement v1-shell to wrap the legacy AngularJS host with state tracking.\n- Update v2-shell Dashboard to track bootstrap events via NgRx.\n- Configure path mappings in tsconfig.base.json for @org/shared-shell and @org/v1-shell.\n- Refactor project.json and tsconfig files to support the new library structure.\n\n* feat(v1): integrate Redux and implement centralized OrderStatus state\n\nIntroduced Redux and ng-redux to the AngularJS v1 application to manage order\nlifecycle states more reliably across components.\n\nKey changes include:\n- Added ''redux'' and ''ng-redux'' dependencies to package.json.\n- Created a centralized ''ORDER_STATUS'' constant and TypeScript type definition\n  to replace hardcoded strings.\n- Implemented ''orderStatusStore'' with a dedicated reducer and actions for\n  handling order state transitions.\n- Configured ''$ngReduxProvider'' in the main module and enabled Redux DevTools\n  support for easier debugging.\n- Updated ''CartController'' to connect to the Redux store, allowing real-time\n  UI updates based on the global order state.\n- Refactored ''PedidosServices'' to dispatch state updates whenever the\n  SignalR hub receives order changes or manual interactions occur.\n- Added ''ORDER_STATUS'' as a global AngularJS constant for dependency injection.\n- Synchronized the shared shell state to include ''ORDER_STATUS'' for\n  cross-app compatibility.","tree":{"sha":"bc01be62170d32f1e7a0a47674205c1b7929843d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ariel-gallardo/restaurante/git/trees/bc01be62170d32f1e7a0a47674205c1b7929843d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ariel-gallardo/restaurante/git/commits/db8e0472689bbe968b866ef094f5e9b81cf9a897","verification":{"payload":"tree bc01be62170d32f1e7a0a47674205c1b7929843d\nparent 675450e2a9f3f1a25e4a04a062db7eb8d8d17000\nauthor Ariel Gallardo <38444032+ariel-gallardo@users.noreply.github.com> 1776358526 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776358526 -0300\n\nFeature/shell (#28)\n\n* refactor: restructure monorepo into versioned apps and libs\n- Rename apps/legacy-angularjs to apps/v1 and apps/restaurante-v2 to apps/v2.\n- Update workspace naming conventions from @org to @resto for better domain alignment.\n- Migrate LegacyHostComponent and ShellModule logic into dedicated libraries (libs/v1 and libs/v2).\n- Configure Nx project.json and tsconfig files to support the new directory structure and path mappings.\n- Clean up boilerplate files including the default nx-welcome component and unused routes.\n- Update the v2 bootstrap process to utilize the new library-based ShellModule.\n\n* refactor: restructure monorepo by modularizing shell and legacy-host libs\n\nRefactors the project structure to improve domain isolation and dependency management within the Nx monorepo.\n\nKey changes include:\n- Created a dedicated `@resto/shell` library under `libs/v2/shell`, moving the main dashboard and shell module logic out of the generic `v2` library.\n- Created a standalone `@resto/legacy-host` library within `libs/v1` to encapsulate the mounting logic for legacy (v1) components.\n- Updated `tsconfig.base.json` with new path mappings for the relocated libraries.\n- Standardized project configurations (ESLint, TSConfig, and Project JSON) for the new sub-libraries.\n- Cleaned up exports in the original `v1` and `v2` entry points to reflect the new architecture.\n- Adjusted the main application bootstrap in `apps/v2` to consume the new shell package.\n\n* refactor(shell): relocate shell library to a nested directory structure\nRelocated the shell library from ''libs/v2/shell'' to ''libs/v2/src/lib/shell'' to align with the project''s folder architecture.\n\nThis change includes:\n- Updated relative paths in ''tsconfig.json'', ''tsconfig.lib.json'', and ''eslint.config.mjs''.\n- Corrected ''sourceRoot'' and schema paths in ''project.json''.\n- Adjusted path mappings in ''tsconfig.base.json'' to maintain ''@resto/shell'' imports.\n- Added a project reference to ''v1/tsconfig.lib.json'' within the shell''s library configuration.\n\n* feat(state): implement NgRx and cross-app shared shell tracking\n\n- Add @ngrx/store, @ngrx/effects, and @ngrx/store-devtools dependencies.\n- Create libs/shared/shell to manage aggregate state between versions.\n- Implement v1-shell to wrap the legacy AngularJS host with state tracking.\n- Update v2-shell Dashboard to track bootstrap events via NgRx.\n- Configure path mappings in tsconfig.base.json for @org/shared-shell and @org/v1-shell.\n- Refactor project.json and tsconfig files to support the new library structure.\n\n* feat(v1): integrate Redux and implement centralized OrderStatus state\n\nIntroduced Redux and ng-redux to the AngularJS v1 application to manage order\nlifecycle states more reliably across components.\n\nKey changes include:\n- Added ''redux'' and ''ng-redux'' dependencies to package.json.\n- Created a centralized ''ORDER_STATUS'' constant and TypeScript type definition\n  to replace hardcoded strings.\n- Implemented ''orderStatusStore'' with a dedicated reducer and actions for\n  handling order state transitions.\n- Configured ''$ngReduxProvider'' in the main module and enabled Redux DevTools\n  support for easier debugging.\n- Updated ''CartController'' to connect to the Redux store, allowing real-time\n  UI updates based on the global order state.\n- Refactored ''PedidosServices'' to dispatch state updates whenever the\n  SignalR hub receives order changes or manual interactions occur.\n- Added ''ORDER_STATUS'' as a global AngularJS constant for dependency injection.\n- Synchronized the shared shell state to include ''ORDER_STATUS'' for\n  cross-app compatibility.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp4RR+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAX7kQABO6t5Q4Q1NU1IH+3zesh1vB\nHuPLf9+uMnnN3Gdtfry2EPEAJHll7CMtx1/Q+1sCF9dEnaPkPa2ppZYlkGKUNzqy\nUU04hrHJDWUeODuP9n/j3JB79f1/KLFVqsYCj714j1m1Z9HAr+48vPp6xF6X6Eew\n+YTDbhl37nxt0oCRZfUQYfHLpjIJFRrp8J9XmHEyCHtGDuPeCr9qSuCd5lvGfsYA\n127hTQB08hKJqAY9N3AWw98ay11YL6BU4ZrBMmnWS83RCUPDqdxLpNxMlH64yiMO\nAQnbY2oGTLAIkZSl6g6RHiTZYZhr4UO26MYoRYI6e6mTqkqt6njOkCMUQOu8ZkT0\n2o+hiG9XD+RohFvcSKmZB0RZNBUxMx+q/G7RAk51nIB7iEZbcLYuNxqa3tufQ+A9\nWmZ00Lp1c8tXaN1pzXBbvHo8ZzMsV9Pj+Jm0KItF4e0sopOIafcCdem/hGetsBHU\nMw4BKjXTBt+o7c71ouVF69oCVyOf/+Cfq7NudbCBPOGNipIUq6YiZjXw782C3j5G\nCWHWsXyQNtVxivUHGHk3aoiBi2obRXgtYAjV5oAPCgKV3wtXQIywKZur5ArKGWWS\nj6CT0+IaIB0lEqAFamH7aI4H15srQ4eyPWn0ivmn5YYMqtTmNwcK4A7emsasIE+Z\nzv07Jqa+IX7iM89LwMvJ\n=uCdB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-16T16:55:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"ht