n- Database dependencies with health checks (PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis)\n- Environment variables and volume mounts for development\n\nProduction Setup:\n- Dockerfile.production with nginx optimization and security\n- docker-compose.prod.yml for production deployment\n- Multi-stage builds for minimal image sizes\n- Non-root user, health checks, and proper caching\n\nCI/CD Pipeline:\n- GitHub Actions workflow with 6 comprehensive jobs\n- Matrix builds for all 8 apps with parallel execution\n- Docker multi-platform builds (linux/amd64, linux/arm64)\n- Integration tests, security scanning (Trivy, npm audit)\n- Staging deployment with smoke tests\n- Performance testing (Lighthouse CI, k6 load tests)\n- Codecov integration and Slack notifications\n\nDocumentation:\n- DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md: Complete deployment guide (400+ lines)\n- DOCKER_SUCCESS.md: Success summary with quick access guide\n- Comprehensive troubleshooting and best practices\n\nAll 19 containers tested and running successfully!","tree":{"sha":"f281e6c79e766dc7b4ab341bbe980ad7ee9140be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magas-xlr/elementa-mon/git/trees/f281e6c79e766dc7b4ab341bbe980ad7ee9140be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magas-xlr/elementa-mon/git/commits/82ba6f7fa374c3b19393de659569eeb702b545b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38702578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cydrake","id":38702578,"login":"cydrake","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NzAyNTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/rece