"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magas-xlr/elementa-mon/commits/60f45d500ab3675875609047820b364776d30389/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-11T14:07:08Z","email":"francomathmagal@gmail.com","name":"Cydrake"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-11T14:07:08Z","email":"francomathmagal@gmail.com","name":"Cydrake"},"message":"feat: Add 10 additional Angular libraries for game functionality\n\nGenerate remaining shared and game-specific libraries to complete\nthe monorepo structure for ElementaMon game development.\n\nShared Libraries (4):\n- data-access: Data fetching and API integration\n- utils: Helper functions and utilities\n- types: Additional TypeScript type definitions\n- constants: Game constants and configuration values\n\nGame Libraries (6):\n- battle-logic: Battle mechanics and turn-based combat logic\n- pets: Pet management and evolution system\n- cards: Card system and deck management\n- inventory-logic: Inventory management and item handling\n- progression: Player progression and leveling system\n- world: World generation and dungeon navigation\n\nAll libraries are:\n- Standalone Angular libraries with ng-packagr\n- Buildable for independent compilation\n- Include Jest test configuration\n- Have path mappings in tsconfig.base.json\n- Follow consistent project structure\n\nTotal libraries: 13 (3 initial + 10 new)\nImport paths: @elementamon/shared-*, @elementamon/game-*","tree":{"sha":"3a2d8316cf89295de3f594274c2bb5b186960659","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magas-xlr/elementa-mon/git/trees/3a2d8316cf89295de3f594274c2bb5b186960659"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magas-xlr/elementa-mon/git/commits/60f45d500ab3675875609047820b364776d30389","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38702578?v=4","events_u