/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magas-xlr/elementa-mon/commits/3ef5444b013c880b4723a15c7c06d09b9852a347/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-11T13:57:55Z","email":"francomathmagal@gmail.com","name":"Cydrake"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-11T13:57:55Z","email":"francomathmagal@gmail.com","name":"Cydrake"},"message":"chore: Initialize ElementaMon monorepo with Angular 20 and Nx 20\n\nSetup Nx monorepo with pnpm workspaces, TypeScript 5.8.3, ESLint 9,\nPrettier, Jest, Playwright, Docker Compose, and GitHub Actions CI/CD.\n\nAngular Applications (7 microfrontends):\n- shell (Module Federation host, port 4200) - RUNNING\n- home (port 4201)\n- deck-builder (port 4202)\n- battle (port 4203)\n- world-map (port 4204)\n- inventory (port 4205)\n- avatar-customization (port 4206)\n- game-over (port 4207)\n\nShared Libraries (3):\n- shared/models - TypeScript interfaces and types\n- shared/ui-components - Reusable UI components\n- game/state - NgRx state management\n\nDocumentation (71,200+ lines):\n- Comprehensive README files for apps, libs, services\n- Docker, testing, backoffice, and marketing site guides\n- PROJECT_STATUS.md with roadmap and team notes\n\nDependencies (2,133 packages):\n- Angular 20.3.10 with standalone components\n- NgRx 19.2.1 for state management\n- Material UI 19, Tailwind CSS 4, Socket.io 4\n- Apollo Client, Three.js, Chart.js\n\nAll apps use standalone components, OnPush change detection,\nSCSS with Tailwind, esbuild bundler, and comprehensive tests.","tree":{"sha":"e2e6e25f375b5fa20eaf41bb62791823da785a25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magas-xlr/elementa-mon/git/trees/e2e6e25f375b5fa20eaf41bb62791823da785a25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magas-xlr/elementa-mon/git/commits/3ef5444b013c880b4723a15c7c06d09b9852a347","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38702578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cydrake","id":38702578,"login":"cydrake","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NzAyNTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cydrake","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/magas-xlr/elementa-mon/commit/3ef5444b013c880b4723a15c7c06d09b9852a347","node_id":"C_kwDONMuPBdoAKDNlZjU0NDRiMDEzYzg4MGI0NzIzYTE1YzdjMDZkMDliOTg1MmEzNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/magas-xlr/elementa-mon/commit/8311d94af61678612736bbd6f325189fc7d13e95","sha":"8311d94af61678612736bbd6f325189fc7d13e95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magas-xlr/elementa-mon/commits/8311d94af61678612736bbd6f325189fc7d13e95"}],"sha":"3ef5444b013c880b4723a15c7c06d09b9852a347","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magas-xlr/elementa-mon/commits/3ef5444b013c880b4723a15c7c06d09b9852a347"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/magas-xlr/elementa-mon/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=e42aaa897c68b8025b046ba9e8a7c322da