- Add multi-platform production builds with security scanning\n- Update existing workflows with new Dockerfile location\n- Add comprehensive documentation (DOCKER.md, CI_CD.md)\n- Add Makefile targets for Docker management\n- Create integration tests for Docker services\n- Add environment example files for all environments\n- Update README with workflow status badges\n\nNew workflows:\n- docker-test-dev.yml: Fast dev environment validation\n- docker-test-test.yml: Full test suite with pytest\n- docker-build-prod.yml: Multi-platform builds + Trivy scanning\n\nDocker services:\n- MongoDB, Redis, Qdrant, FastAPI API, Celery worker/beat, Ollama (optional)","tree":{"sha":"4c66afb49cb9469b01c4c8b4ec13b1d2f8aeaf44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/git/trees/4c66afb49cb9469b01c4c8b4ec13b1d2f8aeaf44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/git/commits/8dd3fb4cfe19aec1d18d928a43dd56d92e32bec4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116573125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohanbatrain","id":116573125,"login":"rohanbatrain","node_id":"U_kgDOBvLDxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/commit/8dd3fb4cfe19aec1d18d928a43dd56d92e32bec4","node_id":"C_kwDONNLd5doAKDhkZDNmYjRjZmUxOWFlYzFkMThkOTI4YTQzZGQ1NmQ5MmUzMmJlYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/commit/b65bf93f38fb10ba8f6f96f2284cd29ae26baee9","sha":"b65bf93f38fb10ba8f6f96f2284cd29ae26baee9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/commits/b65bf93f38fb10ba8f6f96f2284cd29ae26baee9"}],"sha":"8dd3fb4cfe19aec1d18d928a43dd56d92e32bec4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/commits/8dd3fb4cfe19aec1d18d928a43dd56d92e32bec4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116573125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohanbatrain","id":116573125,"login":"rohanbatrain","node_id":"U_kgDOBvLDxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/commits/b65bf93f38fb10ba8f6f96f2284cd29ae26baee9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-24T19:25:00Z","email":"116573125+rohanbatrain@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Rohan Batra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-24T19:25:00Z","email":"116573125+rohanbatrain@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Rohan Batra"},"message":"feat: Implement comprehensive SBD wallet enhancements with subscription auto-renewal\n\n🎯 Major Features Added:\n\n1. Subscription System (Emotion Tracker Premium)\n   - Created subscription models with plan types (monthly/yearly)\n   - Implemented SubscriptionService with auto-renewal logic\n   - Added subscription API routes (create, status, cancel)\n   - Integrated with shop routes for free item access\n   - Pricing: ₹49/mo (47.5M SBD) or ₹499/yr (475M SBD)\n\n2. Auto-Recurring Debits\n   - Created RecurringDebit model with retry logic\n   - Implemented WalletService for recurring payment management\n   - Support for daily/weekly/monthly/yearly frequencies\n   - 3-day grace period with max 3 retry attempts\n   - Automatic subscription renewal on successful payment\n   - Failed payment handling with subscription cancellation\n\n3. Wallet Notifications\n   - Real-time in-app notifications for wallet events\n   - Notification types: top-up, recurring payment, low balance\n   - Configurable notification preferences\n   - Read/unread status tracking\n   - Bulk mark-as-read functionality\n\n4. Transaction Categories\n   - 6 system categories (subscriptions, shop, transfers, etc.)\n   - Auto-categorization of all transactions\n   - Color-coded categories for UI\n   - Support for custom categories (future)\n\n5. Wallet Settings & Preferences\n   - Configurable low balance thresholds\n   - Notification channel preferences\n   - Budget limits (monthly/category-wise)\n   - Security settings (2FA thresholds, velocity limits)\n\n📁 Files Created:\n- models/subscription_models.py - Subscription data models\n- models/wallet_models.py - Wallet enhancement models\n- services/subscription_service.py - Subscription business logic\n- services/wallet_service.py - Wallet management service\n- routes/subscriptions.py - Subscription API endpoints\n- routes/wallet.py - Wallet enhancement endpoints\n\n📝 Files Modified:\n- main.py - Registered subscription & wallet routers\n- routes/shop/routes.py - Added subscription access checks\n- routes/shop/shop_data.py - Updated pricing (5% SBD discount)\n- docs/SHOP_PRICING_AND_PAYMENTS.md - Updated pricing docs\n\n🔄 Backward Compatibility:\n- Zero breaking changes to existing SBD token system\n- All existing endpoints unchanged\n- New features are opt-in with default values\n- Existing transactions work as-is\n\n🚀 Integration:\n- Subscriptions auto-create recurring debits\n- Recurring debits auto-renew subscriptions\n- Shop routes check subscription status for free access\n- Inventory endpoint returns subscription status\n\n⚙️ Background Task Required:\n- Set up cron job for WalletService.process_due_recurring_debits()\n- Recommended: Daily at 00:00 UTC\n\n📊 Database Collections Added:\n- subscriptions - User subscription records\n- recurring_debits - Recurring payment schedules\n- wallet_notifications - User notifications\n- transaction_categories - Category definitions\n- wallet_settings - User wallet preferences\n\n✅ Testing:\n- All imports verified and working\n- Ready for integration testing\n- Comprehensive error handling implemented","tree":{"sha":"c44cfe7464d5696a24e64224674ce9b9391089fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/git/trees/c44cfe7464d5696a24e64224674ce9b9391089fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/git/commits/b65bf93f38fb10ba8f6f96f2284cd29ae26baee9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116573125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gith