train/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohanbatrain","id":116573125,"login":"rohanbatrain","node_id":"U_kgDOBvLDxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/commits/f89a23f76bc874c208004ae26552b5bddd4ed42f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-24T17:46:37Z","email":"116573125+rohanbatrain@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Rohan Batra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-24T17:46:37Z","email":"116573125+rohanbatrain@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Rohan Batra"},"message":"feat: add currency exchange system with INR support\n\n- Add currency exchange utilities (SBD ↔ INR)\n- Fixed exchange rate: 1 SBD = 0.000001 INR (1 INR = 1,000,000 SBD)\n- Create currency models for requests/responses\n- Add API routes for exchange rate queries and conversions\n- Support multi-currency balance display\n\nAPI Endpoints:\n- GET /currency/rates/{currency} - Get exchange rate\n- POST /currency/convert - Convert between currencies\n- GET /currency/balance/{sbd_amount} - Multi-currency balance\n- GET /currency/rates - All exchange rates\n\nFeatures:\n- Decimal precision support (2 decimal places)\n- Currency formatting with symbols (₹ for INR)\n- Bidirectional conversion (SBD ↔ INR)\n- Extensible for future currencies (USD, EUR)\n\nRelated: #currency-exchange","tree":{"sha":"2288446721740d44ab5db57f6b9905d37f7e8e02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/git/trees/2288446721740d44ab5db57f6b99