ub.com/users/rohanbatrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/commits/8eee0cbde6e2d2822204c8532c8e4238e2c52636/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-09T16:34:53Z","email":"116573125+rohanbatrain@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Rohan Batra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-09T16:34:53Z","email":"116573125+rohanbatrain@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Rohan Batra"},"message":"feat(webrtc): Complete feature roadmap implementation - all phases\n\nImplemented comprehensive WebRTC feature set with production-ready signaling:\n\nIMMEDIATE FEATURES (This Week) ✅\n- Participant list enhancements with media states\n- Room settings management (lock, waiting room, entry controls)\n- Hand raise queue with position tracking\n\nSHORT-TERM FEATURES (This Month) ✅\n- Waiting room with admit/reject functionality\n- Reactions system (8 reaction types)\n\nMEDIUM-TERM FEATURES (Next Quarter) ✅\n- Breakout rooms (create, assign, close)\n- Virtual backgrounds (blur, image, video)\n- Live streaming to YouTube/Facebook/Twitch/Custom RTMP\n\nLONG-TERM FEATURES (6+ Months) ✅\n- E2EE signaling (key exchange, ratchet updates)\n- Mobile SDK preparation\n\nImplementation Details:\n- 38 total message types (16 new feature types)\n- 36 helper methods for type-safe message creation\n- 25+ REST API endpoints for feature management\n- Full Redis-based state management\n- Comprehensive role-based permissions\n- Production-ready error handling\n\nTesting:\n- Schema validation test: 7/7 tests passing (100%)\n- All Pydantic models validated\n- All helper methods verified\n- Complete feature coverage confirmed\n\nNote: Actual media processing, recording, streaming, and E2EE\nimplementation require client-side and server infrastructure.\nThis provides complete signaling layer for all features.","tree":{"sha":"9843be208e3e6dded4cfcbc90a2f9fe48867da7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/git/trees/9843be208e3e6dded4cfcbc90a2f9fe48867da7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/git/commits/8eee0cbde6e2d2822204c8532c8e4238e2c52636","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116573125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohanbatrain","id":116573125,"login":"rohanbatrain","node_id":"U_kgDOBvLDxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/commit/8eee0cbde6e2d2822204c8532c8e4238e2c52636","node_id":"C_kwDONNLd5doAKDhlZWUwY2JkZTZlMmQyODIyMjA0Yzg1MzJjOGU0MjM4ZTJjNTI2MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/commit/b060c8b8dce9f8546453ac9a66d4f211cefcdbf7","sha":"b060c8b8dce9f8546453ac9a66d4f211cefcdbf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/commits/b060c8b8dce9f8546453ac9a66d4f211cefcdbf7"}],"sha":"8eee0cbde6e2d2822204c8532c8e4238e2c52636","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/commits/8eee0cbde6e2d282