: Analytics Dashboard (metrics & monitoring)\n✅ Phase 2: Recording System (session management)\n✅ Participant tracking and room management\n\nTest Files:\n- test_webrtc_prod_complete.py: Full production test (19 tests)\n- test_webrtc_features_quick.py: Quick feature validation (10 tests)\n- test_webrtc_production.py: Core signaling test (7 tests)\n\nAll tests passing - production ready && git push origin refactor/cleanup-20251104","tree":{"sha":"282a40d853e9970953be5d3149f781361f349afd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/git/trees/282a40d853e9970953be5d3149f781361f349afd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/git/commits/b060c8b8dce9f8546453ac9a66d4f211cefcdbf7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116573125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohanbatrain","id":116573125,"login":"rohanbatrain","node_id":"U_kgDOBvLDxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/commit/b060c8b8dce9f8546453ac9a66d4f211cefcdbf7","node_id":"C_kwDONNLd5doAKGIwNjBjOGI4ZGNlOWY4NTQ2N