platform\n\nPhase 1 Features (Immediate - High Impact):\n- ✅ Media Controls: Add mute/unmute, video toggle capabilities\n  - New message types: MEDIA_CONTROL, SCREEN_SHARE_CONTROL\n  - MediaControlPayload and ScreenShareControlPayload schemas\n  - Support for audio, video, and screen-share media types\n\n- ✅ Screen Sharing: Enable screen share signaling\n  - Start/stop screen share controls\n  - Quality settings (low, medium, high)\n  - Screen/window identifier support\n\n- ✅ Room Permissions: Host/moderator/participant roles\n  - RoomRole enum: host, moderator, participant, observer\n  - RoomPermissions model with granular controls\n  - REST API endpoints for role and permission management\n  - Real-time permission updates via WebSocket\n\n- ✅ Chat Integration: Real-time text messaging\n  - ChatMessagePayload with support for text, emoji, system messages\n  - Message reply functionality\n  - Message IDs for tracking conversations\n\nPhase 2 Features (Short-term - Business Value):\n- ✅ Recording System: Session recording and playback\n  - Recording control messages (start, stop, pause, resume)\n  - Recording status tracking with duration and file size\n  - Multiple format support (mp4, webm)\n  - REST API for recording management\n  - Redis-based recording metadata storage\n\n- ✅ File Sharing: P2P file transfer via data channels\n  - File share offer/accept/reject flow\n  - Chunk-based transfer with progress tracking\n  - Transfer completion status\n  - Transfer metadata storage in Redis\n\n- ✅ Network Optimization: Adaptive quality management\n  - Network stats reporting (bandwidth, latency, packet loss, jitter)\n  - Connection quality indicators (excellent, good, fair, poor)\n  - Adaptive quality updates with resolution/bitrate control\n  - Frame rate management\n\n- ✅ Analytics Dashboard: Usage metrics and monitoring\n  - Analytics event tracking in Redis streams\n  - Event type categorization\n  - REST API for analytics retrieval\n  - Analytics summary with statistics\n  - Room-level event aggregation\n\nTechnical Improvements:\n- Extended MessageType enum with 15+ new message types\n- 20+ new Pydantic schemas for type-safe payloads\n- Enhanced WebRtcManager with Phase 1 & 2 methods\n- New REST API endpoints for permissions, recording, analytics\n- Redis-based state management for roles, permissions, recordings\n- Comprehensive helper methods in WebRtcMessage class\n- Full type annotations and documentation\n\nTesting:\n- Created test_webrtc_phase1_phase2.py with comprehensive test coverage\n- Tests for all Phase 1 features (media, screen share, chat, permissions)\n- Tests for all Phase 2 features (recording, file sharing, network, analytics)\n- WebSocket message exchange validation\n- REST API endpoint testing\n- Analytics and metrics validation\n\nArchitecture:\n- Maintains stateless design for horizontal scaling\n- Redis Pub/Sub for real-time message distribution\n- Redis for state management (roles, permissions, recordings, transfers)\n- Backward compatible with existing WebRTC implementation\n- Production-ready error handling and logging\n\nImpact:\n- Transforms basic signaling server into comprehensive communication platform\n- Enables video conferencing, collaboration, and content sharing\n- Provides enterprise-grade features (permissions, recording, analytics)\n- Ready for production deployment with monitoring and optimization","tree":{"sha":"4fc00893f9026b5ef2f8d050a5fa6edb3542eeee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/git/trees/4fc00893f9026b5ef2f8d050a5fa6edb3542eeee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/git/commits/462108c85f60e19a3f3581e047a11bbf15cf999e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116573125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanbatrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.g