github.com/users/rohanbatrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/commits/b9f19a65dbae384b8e7a329835803361ef93a450/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T15:52:23Z","email":"116573125+rohanbatrain@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Rohan Batra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T15:52:23Z","email":"116573125+rohanbatrain@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Rohan Batra"},"message":"feat: Add comprehensive production-ready guides for Family Shop and Wallet integration in Flutter\n\n- Introduced `family_shop_flutter_prod_guide.md` detailing user stories, API endpoints, data models, user flows, admin flows, real-time updates, error handling, integration tips, and example sequence diagrams.\n- Added `family_wallet_complete_guide.md` covering family wallet and shop integration, including token transfers, API endpoints, user flows, and admin management.\n- Implemented migration script `migrate_notification_types.py` to correct notification types in the database.\n- Created `inspect_notification.py` script for inspecting family notifications by request ID.\n- Developed `workspace_manager.py` for managing workspaces, including member management and permissions.\n- Added Pydantic models in `workspace_models.py` for workspace-related data structures.\n- Established API routes in `routes.py` for workspace management, including creation, member management, and access control.\n- Implemented tests in `test_workspaces.py` for workspace creation, access control, and member management.\n- Updated notification preferences test script `test_notification_preferences.py` for endpoint verification.","tree":{"sha":"8d4773b684b2bcd5b6b892a8792bdc72319dac4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/git/trees/8d4773b684b2bcd5b6b892a8792bdc72319dac4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanbatrain/second_brain_database/git/commits/b9f19a65dbae384b8e7a329835803361ef93